{"path":"thread/once_flag","title":"std::once_flag","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>once_flag","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/once_flag","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"The class std::once_flag is a helper structure for std::call_once.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/mutex\">&lt;mutex&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> once_flag<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The class <code>std::once_flag</code> is a helper structure for <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/call_once\">std::call_once</a></span>.\n</p><p>An object of type <code>std::once_flag</code> that is passed to multiple calls to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/call_once\">std::call_once</a></span> allows those calls to coordinate with each other such that only one of the calls will actually run to completion.\n</p><p><code>std::once_flag</code> is neither copyable nor movable.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-member\">\n<h2 id=\"std::once_flag::once_flag\"><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::once_flag::</span>once_flag </h2>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> once_flag<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Constructs an <code>once_flag</code> object. The internal state is set to indicate that no function has been called yet.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/call_once\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>call_once</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes a function only once even if called from multiple threads <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/thread/call_once\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>once_flag</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions"},{"depth":2,"text":"std::once_flag::once_flag","id":"std::once_flag::once_flag"},{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::once_flag","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. The class std::once_flag is a helper structure for std::call_once."},{"label":"Member functions"},{"label":"std::once_flag::once_flag","note":"Constructs an once_flag object. The internal state is set to indicate that no function has been called yet.","children":[{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"See also"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":102,"codeBlockCount":0}
